message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Foodfriends: an agent-based model of vegetarian dietary change in social networks"
abstract: >-
  Agent-based model of how vegetarian dietary behaviour spreads through a social
  network, parameterised from a survey of 5,602 Dutch participants. Tracks
  adoption dynamics, CO2 reductions, and the attribution of downstream change to
  the individuals who triggered it.
